---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const locale = 'en';
const currentPath = '/a-propos';
---
<Layout
  title="About | JANUS Linguistic Agency Lyon — Agata Mich"
  description="JANUS, founded in Lyon in 2021 by Agata Mich: language and intercultural support for international projects, with particular expertise in France–Poland."
  locale={locale}
  currentPath={currentPath}
>
  <section class="bg-anthracite pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>Founded in Lyon · 2021</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-6 leading-tight">The agency that speaks<br/>your <em class="italic text-gold">language.</em></h1>
        <p class="text-white/55 text-base leading-relaxed">JANUS is a Lyon-based language and intercultural agency founded by <strong class="text-white">Agata Mich</strong> — quadrilingual (French, Polish, English, Russian), with an international career in finance in Paris and Switzerland. Financial and international experience in service of business communication.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {[{n:'2021',l:'JANUS founded'},{n:'2016',l:'Language training'},{n:'6',l:'Languages'},{n:'Network',l:'Multilingual professionals'}].map(s => (
          <div class="border border-gold/20 p-5 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gold">{s.n}</p>
            <p class="text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">{s.l}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-anthracite-light border-y border-gold/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Our story</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-8">Experience shaped<br/>by <em class="italic text-gold">international negotiations.</em></h2>
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">I had the opportunity to work in very different environments — institutional, financial, entrepreneurial — in France, Poland and Switzerland, always in international and multicultural contexts. Regular contact with counterparts from different cultures and languages taught me that communication is often the real challenge behind projects.</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Before founding JANUS, I took part in international negotiations that put me right at the heart of the exchanges between the parties. During the acquisition of a Polish company by a French buyer, I spent four months alongside the executive: preparing the negotiations in English, supporting them in Poland, interpreting during the talks and facilitating intercultural exchanges. In Switzerland, I was part of the team working on a project for the acquisition of a hotel by a Russian buyer, as a financial adviser specialising in credit. Two very different settings, one constant: understanding what each party means, not just what it says.</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">This observation first led me to language training in 2016, then to create <strong class="text-white">JANUS</strong> in 2021 — to meet a concrete need: companies going international need support that goes beyond simple translation or standard language lessons. Since then, JANUS has been preparing executives for their international assignments and exchanges, and supporting them on site when needed.</p>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">We chose the name <strong class="text-white">JANUS</strong> — the Roman god with two faces, guardian of passages — because it embodies exactly what we do: open doors between two worlds, look in both directions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Founder's career</p>
        <div class="space-y-0">
          {[
            {years:'2002–2007',titre:'International finance — Paris',desc:'Mergers and acquisitions involving French and Polish companies.'},
            {years:'2007–2014',titre:'Private wealth management — Switzerland',desc:'International private wealth management (Russian-speaking & Israeli clients). Technical rigour, discretion, client relationships.'},
            {years:'2014–2016',titre:'Family Office — Switzerland',desc:'Global multi-jurisdiction private wealth management. Confidentiality and coordination in a multicultural environment.'},
            {years:'2016',titre:'Language training',desc:'First professional activity in language training, before JANUS was created.'},
            {years:'2021 — present',titre:'Founded JANUS',desc:'Executive preparation for international assignments, on-site support for executives, bespoke language training, interpreting, intercultural consulting. MICH is Qualiopi-certified for training activities.'},
          ].map((tl, i, arr) => (
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[16px_1fr] gap-4 pb-8 relative">
              {i < arr.length - 1 && <div class="absolute left-2 top-3 bottom-0 w-px bg-gold/20"></div>}
              <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5 border-2 border-anthracite-light"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">{tl.years}</p>
                <p class="text-white font-medium text-sm mb-1">{tl.titre}</p>
                <p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">{tl.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-anthracite">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-gold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What guides us</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-12">Our values, <em class="italic text-gold">no slogans.</em></h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {[
          {n:'01',titre:'Professionals matched to each assignment',desc:"Multilingual professionals selected for the language, sector and context of each assignment, with attention to nuance, register and subtext."},
          {n:'02',titre:'Culture before grammar',desc:"A correct translation can still fail a negotiation. We train clients to understand how their counterparts think, not just what they say. Intercultural knowledge is the core of our work."},
          {n:'03',titre:'Confidentiality as commitment',desc:"We often work in sensitive contexts — negotiations, audits, restructuring. Confidentiality is part of the framework of every assignment; a non-disclosure agreement can be signed when the project requires it."},
          {n:'04',titre:'Clear objectives',desc:"Every training programme starts from defined objectives."},
          {n:'05',titre:'Responsiveness',desc:"We reply promptly, organise interpreters according to availability and adapt programmes as needs evolve."},
          {n:'06',titre:'Honesty about our limits',desc:"If a need falls outside our expertise, we say so and direct you to the right resource. We prefer to lose a contract than to disappoint."},
        ].map(v => (
          <div class="border border-gold/15 p-6 bg-white/[0.02]">
            <p class="text-gold/30 text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">{v.n}</p>
            <p class="text-white font-medium text-sm mb-3">{v.titre}</p>
            <p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">{v.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-anthracite text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-4">Let's work together.</h2>
    <p class="text-white/45 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto mb-10">Free quote. Your request is handled confidentially from the first contact.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a href="/en/contact" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-anthracite font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-gold-light transition-colors text-sm">Contact us</a>
      <a href="/en/services" class="px-8 py-4 border border-white/20 text-white uppercase tracking-wider hover:border-gold hover:text-gold transition-colors text-sm">Our services</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
